@crew salo-saad
// SW5, the endgame pool (plans/ending-spec.html section 9): said only after you choose to stay. Every line is
// gated by the bare condition "endgame" (EN2 adds it to the line filter, section 22); "endgame:early" marks the
// lines that only make sense in the first two weeks after you stay (RV21).

== chat
? endgame:early
- Hello, hello. Last time on the Halcyon: my twin heard you stayed. He sent a cheer.   #funny
? endgame
- No rush now, is there? Good. I've always thought you were in a bit of a rush.
- Ordinary day in the engine room. Floor clean, coils humming, bed by ten. Lovely.
- I'll show you the slow way to clean a coil housing. Same as the quick way. Slower.   #funny
- The Halcyon thinks the Wren's crew never leave. We don't, much. Now you're one of us.   #warm

== bye
? endgame
- Off you go. Bed by ten, mind. You've no excuse now.   #funny
